//* TP04COMP - COMPARE ORIGINAL SCRATCH PDS TO RESTORED PDS.
//* REVIEW ONLY: MVS EXECUTION REQUIRES SEPARATE APPROVAL.
//* CHECK MEMBER LISTS AND IEBCOMPR OUTPUT INDEPENDENTLY.
//COMPARE  EXEC PGM=IEBCOMPR,REGION=256K
//SYSPRINT DD  SYSOUT=*
//SYSUT1   DD  DSN=HERC02.BCPL.TPTEST.SRC,DISP=SHR
//SYSUT2   DD  DSN=HERC02.BCPL.TPTEST.RESTORE,DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD  *
 COMPARE TYPORG=PO
/*
